                        "form": "czorty"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "99432594-c5e1-31d3-9ffb-7946a5453edc",
                        "entry_id": "7ae0ef39-2115-387c-9c4b-2cf969d3f6ee",
                        "glosses": [
                            "devil, demon (creature of hell)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6651be29-3ca4-4487-bf6c-074c6ae4fe07",
                                "sense_id": "99432594-c5e1-31d3-9ffb-7946a5453edc",
                                "text": "Panowie wasi dawno chcieli waszego szczęścia, ale im car tego zrobić niepozwalał; bo car znaczy nie to co Bóg, ale znaczy to co czort (diabeł).",
                                "translation": "You have long wanted your happiness but the tsar has not allowed this, because the tsar is not God but rather a demon (devil).",
                                "english": "You have long wanted your happiness but the tsar has not allowed this, because the tsar is not God but rather a demon (devil)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c9839362-0b0f-4147-b98a-7493f2baa2cc",
                                "sense_id": "99432594-c5e1-31d3-9ffb-7946a5453edc",
                                "text": "Wiem ja — rzekł — że tobie czort bratem, ale na czorta są sposoby. — Czort nie czort, a sposobu nie ma — odparła Horpyna. — Żeby ty, sokole, na całym świecie schowania dla swojej kniaziówny szukał, to by ty lepszego nie znalazł.",
                                "translation": "\"I know\", he said, \"that the devil is your brother, but a devil has his ways.\n\"Whether he's a devil or not, there's no way,\" Horpyn replied \"for you, falcon, to look for protection for the knyaz's daughter the whole world wide, or for you to find it.\"",
                                "english": "\"I know\", he said, \"that the devil is your brother, but a devil has his ways.\n\"Whether he's a devil or not, there's no way,\" Horpyn replied \"for you, falcon, to look for protection for the knyaz's daughter the whole world wide, or for you to find it.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4f5210c0-b30f-438b-8821-e2cf3b006bd7",
                                "sense_id": "99432594-c5e1-31d3-9ffb-7946a5453edc",
                                "text": "Gada się, bo się gada. Wiesz, że łatałem, jak mogłem, ale... czort dał, czort wziął... I on śmiał zaorać!",
                                "translation": "It's said, because it is said. You know, I patched it up as best I could... but the devil giveth, the devil taketh away... and he dared to plough!",
                                "english": "It's said, because it is said. You know, I patched it up as best I could... but the devil giveth, the devil taketh away... and he dared to plough!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "be1318f6-ad63-4004-bbef-b61632fe5585",
                                "sense_id": "99432594-c5e1-31d3-9ffb-7946a5453edc",
                                "text": "— Tak — mówi wtedy czort — typuj, a ja NUMERA podaję.",
                                "translation": "\"Yes,\" the demon then said. \"Type and I'll give you the NUMBER.",
                                "english": "\"Yes,\" the demon then said. \"Type and I'll give you the NUMBER."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4aec8d71-d251-49e4-aad3-d4cf22a28970",
                                "sense_id": "99432594-c5e1-31d3-9ffb-7946a5453edc",
                                "text": "Gdzie brzydka treść, obrazek czy dźwięk\nTam, tam, tam sypie ziarnem czort.\nTam, tam, tam zbiera potem plon.",
                                "translation": "Where there is ugly content, image, or sound\nThere, there, there the demon sows seed.\nThere, there, there the crop later grows.",
                                "english": "Where there is ugly content, image, or sound\nThere, there, there the demon sows seed.\nThere, there, there the crop later grows."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
